      "ArticleTitle": "A single blinded randomised trial to compare the efficacy and safety of once daily budesonide (400microg) administered by turbuhaler with beclomethasone dipropionate (400microg) given twice daily through a metered-dose inhaler in patients with mild to moderate asthma.",
